     "body": "<p>NB: Check what the XACML 1.0 spec says on this (we are not actually using XACML 2 engine, we don't want to do something that's somehow incompatible with the current implementation).</p>",
     "created": "13/Jul/10 6:16 PM",
     "id": "11478",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10709/comment/11478",
     "updateAuthor": {
